00:21:45.000 --> 00:22:29.000
just having a secret admirer than knowing who sent the flowers. Do you actually try and actively build mystery into your own life when it comes to positive events? I'm not telling. Dan, I want to thank you for talking with me today. This has really been fun. Sure, been fun for me too. Thank you. This week's show was produced by Max Nestrak and edited by Jenny Schmidt. Our team includes Raina Cohen, Parts Shah, Thomas Liu and Laura Quarral. Our supervising producer is Tara Boyle.
